# User Stories

## Project Management

### US-001: Create Project 

As a Project Manager, I want to create a new project so that I can track its delivery health. 

Acceptance Criteria: 

- User can enter project name
- User can enter project description
- User can select project status
- User can save the project
- New project appears in the project list

### US-002: View Project Dashboard

As a Project Manager, I want to view a dashboard of all projects so that I can quickly understand overall delivery health.

Acceptance Criteria:

- User can see all projects
- Each project displays name, status, health, and target date
- Projects are grouped or visually makred by health: Green, Yellow, Red

### US-003: Add Risk

As a Project Manager, I want to add risks to a project so that I can track potential delivery issues.

Acceptance Criteria:

- User can enter risk title
- User can enter description
- User can select probability: Low, Medium, High
- User can select impact: Low, Medium, High
- User can assign an owner
- User can add a mitigation plan
- Risk is linked to a project

### US-004: Calculate Risk Severity

As a Project Manager, I want the system to calculate risk severity so that I can prioritize risks consistently.

Acceptance Criteria:

- Severity is calculated based on probability and impact
- High probability + high impact creates high severity
- Low probability + low impact creates low severity
- Severity is visible in the risk register

### US-005: Add Blocker

As a Project Manager, I want to add blockers to a project so that I can track active impediments.

Acceptance Criteria:

- User can enter blocker title
- User can enter description
- User can assign owner
- User can set status: Open, In Progress, Resolved
- Blocker is linked to a project

### US-006: Add Milestone

As a Projecct Manager, I want to add milestone so that I can track important delivery dates.

Acceptance Criteria:

- User can enter milestone name
- User can enter target date
- User can set status: Not Started, In Progress, Completed, Delayed
- Milestone is linked to a project

### US-007: Generate Weekly Status Report

As a Project Manager, I want to generate a weekly status report so that I can share project updates with stakeholders.

Acceptance Criteria:

- Report includes project name
- Report includes project health
- Report includes open risks
- Report includes open blockers
- Report includes milestone status
- Report includes next steps
